{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Almohadin: escape from the basement</strong> is an indie fast-paced 2D precision platformer packed with colorful visuals and bullet hell action. Face a story-rich cartoony adventure inspired by difficult retro side scroller arcade games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Basement holds many mysteries. Almohadin must take risks and uncover them in order to reach the outside world. Join him on his adventure!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/dc5341686b53d1551ba5eb1faa26aeea.avif?t=1754065622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras_big/dc5341686b53d1551ba5eb1faa26aeea.avif?t=1754065622 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of levels await you with progressive difficulty and the narrative of a visual novel that immerses you in the story of Almohadin, a pillow that magically comes to life and decides to escape from the basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/0539b47134108f18a4a23f93189ecac8.avif?t=1754065622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras_big/0539b47134108f18a4a23f93189ecac8.avif?t=1754065622 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive and fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong> - these powerful individuals will try to kill you with all their might. Defend yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue</strong> - hundreds of subjects are imprisoned in the basement. Make a difference and save them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massacre</strong> - annihilate all the monsters that cross your path. Cleanse the infested areas. Restore peace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics</strong> - along the way, you will find many ways to become more powerful: alfajores that enhance your movement, weapons, teleportation pills, cans of beans that help you fly (I won't explain how...), invincibility potions, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/04e000cf9fb7c0f57f44f8cedc7ccf66.avif?t=1754065622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras_big/04e000cf9fb7c0f57f44f8cedc7ccf66.avif?t=1754065622 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these levels you must win as fast as possible. Compete against other players to see who is the fastest escapist. Some levels are extremely difficult!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/b975cfa34d5aa0ecd3c71ecdf599d1e2.avif?t=1754065622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras_big/b975cfa34d5aa0ecd3c71ecdf599d1e2.avif?t=1754065622 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Run once again...</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Curiosity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/6d370a72cbca2a73aab2e45d71c33d0560f2cb7d.jpg"},{"name":"Terror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/187c8feb6f0ab6b5ad43baf06af1ed7eb43d79ce.jpg"},{"name":"Fuchsia light in the shadows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/98a38faeae4294f495340c700da4b0607bc38879.jpg"},{"name":"Brainiac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/7d8f7969c2a87597ee41484f238d447129626e87.jpg"},{"name":"Quite a show","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/31c9b2f4b9e8911e75982cc6b2ac0bd277b3cc7c.jpg"},{"name":"No deal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/0c049ca3cc260d2cb31471f9631d05a1a1098aef.jpg"},{"name":"*Clich\u00e9 movie explosion*","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/0259ae346ecb8f2407a995538e1e130a02e977f0.jpg"},{"name":"Not extracting anything today","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/3fbb8f7af314a037912ccd79b390ba9b7dca502e.jpg"},{"name":"Rescue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/ebd145940d8e3a29c9cdc4a9a671cbb306d2f337.jpg"},{"name":"Destination Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3157360/71ef5e97aa42bdc9b92080922b07bd4c0b30a4a2.jpg"}],"total":86},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3157360?t=1754065622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/1e79b69eff494566d3caa92e5db1b60e4de41341/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754065622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/8bacaeafd8adfdd5e7e578a726e972389916b96d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754065622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/8bacaeafd8adfdd5e7e578a726e972389916b96d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754065622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Almohadin: escape from the basement</strong> is an indie fast-paced 2D precision platformer packed with colorful visuals and bullet hell action. Face a story-rich cartoony adventure inspired by difficult retro side scroller arcade games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Basement holds many mysteries. Almohadin must take risks and uncover them in order to reach the outside world. Join him on his adventure!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/dc5341686b53d1551ba5eb1faa26aeea.avif?t=1754065622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras_big/dc5341686b53d1551ba5eb1faa26aeea.avif?t=1754065622 width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of levels await you with progressive difficulty and the narrative of a visual novel that immerses you in the story of Almohadin, a pillow that magically comes to life and decides to escape from the basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/0539b47134108f18a4a23f93189ecac8.avif?t=1754065622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras_big/0539b47134108f18a4a23f93189ecac8.avif?t=1754065622 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive and fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong> - these powerful individuals will try to kill you with all their might. Defend yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue</strong> - hundreds of subjects are imprisoned in the basement. Make a difference and save them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massacre</strong> - annihilate all the monsters that cross your path. Cleanse the infested areas. Restore peace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics</strong> - along the way, you will find many ways to become more powerful: alfajores that enhance your movement, weapons, teleportation pills, cans of beans that help you fly (I won't explain how...), invincibility potions, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/04e000cf9fb7c0f57f44f8cedc7ccf66.avif?t=1754065622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras_big/04e000cf9fb7c0f57f44f8cedc7ccf66.avif?t=1754065622 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these levels you must win as fast as possible. Compete against other players to see who is the fastest escapist. Some levels are extremely difficult!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras/b975cfa34d5aa0ecd3c71ecdf599d1e2.avif?t=1754065622\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/extras_big/b975cfa34d5aa0ecd3c71ecdf599d1e2.avif?t=1754065622 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Run once again...</i></p>","developers":["Talio Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157360/afb9307943be0d3810658799ee28b012c7539976/header.jpg?t=1754065622","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Glibc 2.17+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requiremen